    "profile_title": "Dual Color, 0.2mm layer, 2 walls, 15% infill",
    "profile_notes": "Dual Color, 0.2mm layer, 2 walls, 15% infill This profile offers an alternative two-color presentation of the original model while keeping AMS printing simple and efficient. The color layout was redesigned to add contrast and highlight key details using only six filament changes , reducing purge waste and print interruptions while maintaining the overall appearance of the original design. Minor print setting adjustments were made to support consistent results, including a slower first layer for improved adhesion, light quality tuning, infill adjustments, and conservative speed refinements. The profile uses a 0.20 mm layer height with 15% infill for a balanced combination of print quality and efficiency. Rectilinear infill used for more consistent weighed fill on moving parts. Profile Highlights Alternative two-color appearance Elephant foot compensation adjusted to allow secure first layer adhesion. Only 6 filament changes Reduced purge waste and AMS operations Slower first layer for reliable adhesion Minor quality-focused speed adjustments 0.20 mm layer height 15% infill 2 walls Original model geometry unchanged",
